  "term": "triptan",
  "definition": "A triptan is a medication used to relieve migraine pain and related symptoms. It acts on serotonin 5-HT1B/1D receptors, which can narrow blood vessels inside the skull and reduce release of pro-inflammatory neuropeptides in the trigeminal system.",
